{"title":"Black Walnut Anvil","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 62)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 62 <span class=\"muted\">(1688 XP)</span> from 14× <a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-plank\">Black Walnut Plank</a>, 6× <a href=\"#/item/gold-fittings\">Gold Fittings</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-anvil\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e028623dd51cb2142ec0.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Anvil</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-anvil\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/87f794841bec4a263d70.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Anvil</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-plank\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/85a7e391ba103f3a66d6.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Plank</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/40b20b0e79e7d3081f64.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Fittings</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/2f316da1fe037ca3fea8.svg\" alt=\"Black Walnut Anvil\"></div><h3>Black Walnut Anvil</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Carpentry 62</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}